{
    "title": "Potty Whiz: Potty Training Log",
    "description": "Potty Whiz - the ultimate potty training companion, designed by parents for parents! Say goodbye to the potty training blues and help your little one become a potty-trained whiz in no time. With no login or internet required, Potty Whiz is always ready to assist you in your potty training journey.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udebd No Login or Internet Required: Enjoy seamless access to Potty Whiz anytime, anywhere, without the need for an internet connection.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc76 Parent-Centric Design: Created with parents in mind, Potty Whiz is user-friendly and tailored to support you through the challenges of potty training.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd Activity Tracker: Keep track of your child's potty progress by logging important activities, such as sitting on the potty, going to the potty, accidents, and fluid intake.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Potty Training Timer: Never miss a potty break with our handy timer that reminds you when your little one needs to go.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Potty Training Tips: Benefit from practical tips to make potty training more effective and enjoyable for you and your child, such as creating a schedule, getting your child involved, and offering rewards and praise.\r\n\r\nWith Potty Whiz, you'll be able to:\r\n\r\n\u2705 Easily log activities like sitting on the potty, going to the potty, accidents, and fluid intake to track your child's progress.\r\n\u2705 Keep track of essential details, such as whether your child told you they needed to go, wiped, flushed the potty, and washed their hands.\r\n\u2705 Set up a potty training timer to receive reminders and keep your child on track.\r\n\u2705 Follow potty training tips and strategies to make the process smoother and more enjoyable for both you and your child.\r\n\r\nReady to make potty training a breeze? Download Potty Whiz now and let the magic begin! Your child will be a potty-trained whiz before you know it.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7 Need help? Contact us at help@kidplay.app.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.kidplay.app/terms/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.kidplay.app/privacy-policy/\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb3 Subscription Details:\r\n\r\nPotty Whiz offers auto-renewing subscriptions charged to your iTunes account upon purchase confirmation. Subscriptions automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage your subscription and turn off auto-renewal through your iTunes account settings. Cancellation of the current active subscription period is not allowed.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Potty Whiz - the ultimate potty training companion, designed by parents for parents! Say goodbye to the potty training blues and help your little one become a potty-trained whiz in no time. With no login or internet required, Potty Whiz is always ready to assist you in your potty training journey.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\ud83d\udebd No Login or Internet Required: Enjoy seamless access to Potty Whiz anytime, anywhere, without the need for an internet connection.<br><br>\ud83d\udc76 Parent-Centric Design: Created with parents in mind, Potty Whiz is user-friendly and tailored to support you through the challenges of potty training.<br><br>\ud83d\udcdd Activity Tracker: Keep track of your child&#39;s potty progress by logging important activities, such as sitting on the potty, going to the potty, accidents, and fluid intake.<br><br>\ud83d\udd14 Potty Training Timer: Never miss a potty break with our handy timer that reminds you when your little one needs to go.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 Potty Training Tips: Benefit from practical tips to make potty training more effective and enjoyable for you and your child, such as creating a schedule, getting your child involved, and offering rewards and praise.<br><br>With Potty Whiz, you&#39;ll be able to:<br><br>\u2705 Easily log activities like sitting on the potty, going to the potty, accidents, and fluid intake to track your child&#39;s progress.<br>\u2705 Keep track of essential details, such as whether your child told you they needed to go, wiped, flushed the potty, and washed their hands.<br>\u2705 Set up a potty training timer to receive reminders and keep your child on track.<br>\u2705 Follow potty training tips and strategies to make the process smoother and more enjoyable for both you and your child.<br><br>Ready to make potty training a breeze? Download Potty Whiz now and let the magic begin! Your child will be a potty-trained whiz before you know it.<br><br>\ud83d\udce7 Need help? Contact us at help@kidplay.app.<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.kidplay.app/terms/<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.kidplay.app/privacy-policy/<br><br>\ud83d\udcb3 Subscription Details:<br><br>Potty Whiz offers auto-renewing subscriptions charged to your iTunes account upon purchase confirmation. Subscriptions automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage your subscription and turn off auto-renewal through your iTunes account settings. Cancellation of the current active subscription period is not allowed.",
